scope: |
  Two backendRust tests are red on origin/main from MY Any-boundary change (3ac30f018) -- a sibling
  found them while working next to me and filed them without a claim, correctly noting nobody was
  watching. A golden red on main means the next person to touch this backend inherits a suite that
  cannot tell them whether they broke something. Mine to fix, ahead of any new work.
  Then, with the file free: reachability -- emit only what the entry point reaches, so importing
  std/json stops dragging json-core's .ssc bodies in when jsonParse/jsonStringify are intrinsics.
